  "content": "\n\n<p><img width=\"380\" height=\"224\" alt=\"Shadow Drop\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c5ec8a5-b35e-4f08-90c8-b6a27a3efa61\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"fabric\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"neoforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\"></a></p>\n<p>一款精巧的客户端模组，为 GUI 界面中的物品下方添加投影效果，为快捷栏、背包界面、\n进度等内容增添层次感。默认情况下，投影为半透明，向下/向右偏移一个像素，并裁剪以适配物品栏位。</p>\n<p>由于投影会与现有的渲染调用合并批处理，此分支对性能的影响<strong>几乎可以忽略不计</strong>！</p>\n<p><img width=\"1600\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Shadow Drop 示例\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ab817a1-1c61-429a-8771-af39e3ccc3e4\"></p>\n<p>可通过生成的 <code>shadowdrop-client.toml</code> 文件配置投影效果。</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>注意：裁剪投影时，物品栏位是通过检测每个物品右下角像素的颜色来识别的。\n  若资源包或模组 GUI 中该像素颜色并非 #FFFFFF，请调整 <code>slotBrColors</code> 以确保兼容性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p>⚠ <strong>可能需要配置才能实现良好兼容性的模组：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Accelerated Rendering</strong>：禁用 <code>gui_acceleration</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>注：EMI（<code>use-batched-renderer</code>）和 ImmediatelyFast（<code>hud_batching</code>）现已完全兼容。</em></p>\n<h2>许可证</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/evanbones/Shadow-Drop/blob/1.20.1/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-MIT-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"代码许可证 (MIT)\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fJcGRdT6Pbx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/evanbones/Shadow-Drop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/github-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"github-plural\"></a></p>",
